  "title": "Coffee Date Bread",
  "description": "Bake a loaf of this dark, wonderfully moist coffee date bread to serve with holiday meals. If you're lucky to have any leftovers, they're great for breakfast!",
  "authors": [
    "MOMZRIGHT"
  ],
